<title>USA: Montgomery Cty SDFC, Ky., won by NatCity.</title>
<headline>Montgomery Cty SDFC, Ky., won by NatCity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatCity Investments said it won $5.360 million of Montgomery Cty SDFC, Ky., school building revenue bonds, Series 1997 B, with a  net interest cost of 4.969 percent.</p>
</text>
